{
  "id": "E200",
  "title": "At the Print Shop",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-03-04",
  "synopsis": "It is both cheap and convenient to print documents at a print shop.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/678/0c9db4b14dc903d3514e3c73e524dd30bd240f0e.mp3?1519570240",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "在复印店  \n\n保罗：你好！我想要复印这份文件。\n复印店老板：复印几份？\n保罗：三份，彩印，正反面复印。\n复印店老板：好的。\n保罗：然后我还要打印一份文件。\n复印店老板：你带U盘了吗？可以用那台电脑。\n保罗：好的，谢谢！",
    "traditional": "在複印店  \n\n保羅：你好！我想要複印這份文件。\n複印店老闆：複印幾份？\n保羅：三份，彩印，正反面複印。\n複印店老闆：好的。\n保羅：然後我還要打印一份文件。\n複印店老闆：你帶U盤了嗎？可以用那臺電腦。\n保羅：好的，謝謝！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "  \n\n",
      "traditional": "  \n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "At the Print Shop"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：你好！我想要复印这份文件。",
      "traditional": "保羅：你好！我想要複印這份文件。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nǐ hǎo wǒ xiǎng yào fù yìn zhè fèn wén jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Hello. I would like to copy this document."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "复印店老板：复印几份？",
      "traditional": "複印店老闆：複印幾份？",
      "pinyin": "fù yìn diàn lǎo bǎn fù yìn jǐ fèn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop Owner: How many copies?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：三份，彩印，正反面复印。",
      "traditional": "保羅：三份，彩印，正反面複印。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó sān fèn cǎi yìn zhèng fǎn miàn fù yìn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Three copies, with color, double-sided."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "复印店老板：好的。",
      "traditional": "複印店老闆：好的。",
      "pinyin": "fù yìn diàn lǎo bǎn hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop Owner: Fine."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：然后我还要打印一份文件。",
      "traditional": "保羅：然後我還要打印一份文件。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó rán hòu wǒ hái yào dǎ yìn yí fèn wén jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I also need to print a document."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "复印店老板：你带U盘了吗？可以用那台电脑。",
      "traditional": "複印店老闆：你帶U盤了嗎？可以用那臺電腦。",
      "pinyin": "fù yìn diàn lǎo bǎn nǐ dài U pán le ma kě yǐ yòng nà tái diàn nǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop Owner: Did you bring a USB stick with you? You can use that computer."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "保罗：好的，谢谢！",
      "traditional": "保羅：好的，謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo de xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Alright, thank you!"
    }
  ],
